t (Formant)","Source"]],["p-b67a49d94a8b9ea6.html","source-block-106","Interval (Formant)",[]],["p-b67a49d94a8b9ea6.html","source-block-129","Set by the Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Wave while the oscillator model is Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Formant.",["Interval (Formant)"]],["p-b67a49d94a8b9ea6.html","source-block-260","Sets the frequency ratio between formants one and two.",["Interval (Formant)"]],["p-b67a49d94a8b9ea6.html","source-block-318","Source",["Interval (Formant)"]],["p-b67a49d94a8b9ea6.html","source-block-331","Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/03 Types/09 Formant",["Interval (Formant)","Source"]],["p-c0a80f4fde69bc20.html","source-block-106","Shape (Formant)",[]],["p-c0a80f4fde69bc20.html","source-block-126","Set by the Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Shape while the oscillator model is Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Formant.",["Shape (Formant)"]],["p-c0a80f4fde69bc20.html","source-block-258","Sets formant width and shape by controlling the window applied to the sum of two synchronized sine oscillators.",["Shape (Formant)"]],["p-c0a80f4fde69bc20.html","source-block-373","Source",["Shape (Formant)"]],["p-c0a80f4fde69bc20.html","source-block-386","Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/03 Types/09 Formant",["Shape (Formant)","Source"]],["p-aee28949197567a9.html","source-block-204","HARM Oscillator (Harm)",[]],["p-aee28949197567a9.html","source-block-231","Oscillator model 16 of 22 on the Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type, shown on the display as Harm.",["HARM Oscillator (Harm)"]],["p-aee28949197567a9.html","source-block-337","Parameters",["HARM Oscillator (Harm)"]],["p-aee28949197567a9.html","source-block-354","Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Wave → Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/HARM/Spread",["HARM Oscillator (Harm)","Parameters"]],["p-aee28949197567a9.html","source-block-452","Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Timbre → Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/HARM/Rectification",["HARM Oscillator (Harm)","Parameters"]],["p-aee28949197567a9.html","source-block-559","Micr