nob/Type/KarplusStr.",["Decay (KarplusStr)"]],["p-3682fbc84fcca913.html","source-block-267","Sets the resonator's resonance by controlling its decay.",["Decay (KarplusStr)"]],["p-3682fbc84fcca913.html","source-block-327","Source",["Decay (KarplusStr)"]],["p-3682fbc84fcca913.html","source-block-340","Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/03 Types/05 KarplusStr",["Decay (KarplusStr)","Source"]],["p-704078be33b01980.html","source-block-109","Position (KarplusStr)",[]],["p-704078be33b01980.html","source-block-135","Set by the Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Timbre while the oscillator model is Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/KarplusStr.",["Position (KarplusStr)"]],["p-704078be33b01980.html","source-block-271","Controls where and how hard the resonator is struck. It does not affect the bowed part of the sound.",["Position (KarplusStr)"]],["p-704078be33b01980.html","source-block-375","Source",["Position (KarplusStr)"]],["p-704078be33b01980.html","source-block-388","Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc/03 Types/05 KarplusStr",["Position (KarplusStr)","Source"]],["p-b4046f0fcd7c41dc.html","source-block-203","Modal Resonator (Modal)",[]],["p-b4046f0fcd7c41dc.html","source-block-231","Oscillator model 12 of 22 on the Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type, shown on the display as Modal.",["Modal Resonator (Modal)"]],["p-b4046f0fcd7c41dc.html","source-block-338","Parameters",["Modal Resonator (Modal)"]],["p-b4046f0fcd7c41dc.html","source-block-355","Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Wave → Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Modal/Inharm",["Modal Resonator (Modal)","Parameters"]],["p-b4046f0fcd7c41dc.html","source-block-454","Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Timbre → Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Modal/Timbre",["Modal Resonator (Modal)","Parameters"]],["p-b4046f0fcd7c41dc.html","source-block-555","Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Shape → Microfreak/UI/Oscillator/Knob/Type/Modal/Decay",["Modal Resonator (Modal)","Parameters"]],["p-b4046f0fcd7c41dc.html","source-block-654","Source",["Modal Resonator (Modal)"]],[